 lang="EN"><p>A disk apparatus provided with a lock mechanism, in which the whole player section supported in an external chassis with a cushioning material is displaced to the disk slot side by the movement of a load/eject cam flap (112) which composes a part of the player section, with the result that part of the player section is pressed against the disk slot side.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un appareil à disque pourvu d'un mécanisme de blocage, dans lequel l'ensemble de la section lecteur supportée dans un châssis extérieur avec un matériau d'amortissement, est déplacé du côté de la fente de disque par le mouvement d'un volet à came chargement/éjection (112), qui est une partie de ladite section, le résultat étant qu'une partie de celle-ci est pressée contre le côté de la fente de disque.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>